%% API usage_inbox row and worker accounting are independent durable transactions.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Sandbox platform
    participant A as Go billing API
    participant W as Go usage worker
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    Note over P,D: Row selector: customer_billing_state.customer_id = C<br/>Event row: usage_inbox.source = S and usage_inbox.event_id = E<br/>Catalog advisory (65102, 2): protects price_versions, not a column

    Note over P: Persist pending events before sending.<br/>Retain IDs and content when batching or retrying.
    P->>A: POST /usage/batches
    A->>D: BEGIN<br/>INSERT usage_inbox with explicit UTC received_at
    A->>D: COMMIT complete usage_inbox row batch
    D-->>A: Durable usage_inbox rows<br/>accounting may still be pending
    A--xP: 202 accepted response is lost

    P->>A: Retry the same event identities and content
    A->>D: BEGIN<br/>INSERT ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING<br/>Compare existing measurement fields<br/>FOR SHARE<br/>usage_inbox.source = S<br/>usage_inbox.event_id = E
    alt Identical identities and content
        D-->>A: Original usage_inbox rows, unchanged received_at and processing state
        A->>D: COMMIT without modifying existing usage_inbox rows
        A-->>P: 202 accepted
        Note over P: Mark acknowledged events as delivered.
    else An existing identity has different content
        A->>D: ROLLBACK the entire batch, including any new usage_inbox rows
        A-->>P: 409 event_conflict
    end

    Note over W,D: Accounting may occur before or after the producer retries.
    W->>D: Select a pending usage_inbox row<br/>BEGIN<br/>lock customer account
    W->>D: Shared catalog lock<br/>reload FOR UPDATE<br/>usage_inbox.source = S<br/>usage_inbox.event_id = E
    alt usage_inbox row still pending and valid
        W->>W: Historical rating and exact credit allocation
        W->>D: Write group, rating link, credit debit, monthly gross and account state
        W->>D: Mark processed_at<br/>COMMIT financial effects together
    else Already processed by another worker
        W->>D: COMMIT without further financial effects
    else Domain error, including missing valid price
        W->>D: Set processing_error<br/>COMMIT without financial effects
    end
    Note over A,D: usage_inbox row success requires durable commit.<br/>Unknown commit outcomes use unchanged producer retries.<br/>The API never acknowledges completed financial accounting.
